  "collectionNotes": [
    "未实机验证；本模型只有exact-SKU照片约束的外观近似，未找到该SKU的独立完整厂家CAD/PCB布局。",
    "未知PCB的轮廓/厚度、隐藏元件与插口深度均保持估算；照片丝印不等于可制造PCB或固件兼容。",
    "已实现原版ESP32-C3 KMeter数字子集：客体经SCLK6/MISO5/CS7读取MAX31855，实际解码正负温度与断线故障，并保留GPIO1读取指示。冷端25°C与100ms转换为披露的模型假设；未验证温度校准、I2C从机应用、原厂固件或实物。",
    "未进行浏览器三种材质/同视角叠图验收；静态照片不会覆盖任何固件显示画面。",
    "U133原型内部MCU为ESP32-C3，不能把U133-V11隔离版的STM32F030F4P6、固件或壳体版本复制进来。Flash/PSRAM未据资料确定；I2C@0x66为真实硬件事实但从机应用未验证；MAX31855数字转换/故障/SPI读数路径已实现。",
    "Runtime digital subset and actual guest/negative checks: docs/platform/m5-edge-runtime-20261126.md. These checks do not establish factory firmware compatibility or hardware validation.",
    "Physical Flash capacity remains unverified. The digital runtime uses an explicitly named 4 MiB simulation setting; this is not a hardware fact.",
    "The explicit synthetic25C cold junction remains in D15..4 when the probe is open. OC/D16 mark thermocouple data invalid; no valid0C hot-junction reading is inferred from the zeroed invalid bits.",
    "Actual batch020 compiled production Worker/WASM checks passed this SKU and its configured negatives; exact guest observations and hashes: docs/platform/evidence/m5-edge-runtime-20261126/worker-020.json. This validates the declared digital subset, not factory firmware or physical hardware."
  ]
}
